        "detailed_description": "<u><strong>Rated Sudoku helps you learn faster and sharpen your Sudoku skills with a powerful set of tools for every part of the Sudoku experience, from playing and analyzing to editing, generating, and painting.</strong></u><br><br><u><strong>Built on a high performance solving engine, our Analyze Screen identifies complex techniques quickly — much faster than typical Sudoku games.</strong></u><br><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Note: This game supports <strong>ONLY standard 9x9</strong> Sudoku rules. No variants (e.g., Killer Sudoku) are included.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Note: It is <strong>NOT</strong> recommended to play this game on Steam Deck.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Hint System - Help When You Need It Most</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stuck on a puzzle? Get help right from the Play Screen. The game offers two levels of hints: vague hints and detailed hints. Click the hint button once to receive a vague hint with partial highlighting, giving you a chance to spot the technique on your own. Click it again to reveal a detailed hint with full highlighting and a full explanation. The explanation is detailed enough that you might even learn the technique on the spot.</p><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2699950/extras/d23c6ae9038337c8b1fac8b59d2bd7f2.poster.avif?t=1781837826\" width=1170 height=674 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2699950/extras/d23c6ae9038337c8b1fac8b59d2bd7f2.webm?t=1781837826\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2699950/extras/d23c6ae9038337c8b1fac8b59d2bd7f2.mp4?t=1781837826\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Play - Efficient Input System</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tired of slow manual input of candidates and making mistakes? Our unique skill input system revolutionizes the way you play Sudoku. Simply spot a pattern like an X-Wing, select a relevant cell, click the &quot;Fish&quot; skill, and watch the eliminations happen automatically. No more manual candidate management or fear of errors—the game handles the work, letting you focus on the fun of solving. If the skill doesn't apply to the cell, nothing will happen, ensuring a completely error-free experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2699950/extras/a6092287464e70697d73de8ee8eb56db.poster.avif?t=1781837826\" width=1170 height=674 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2699950/extras/a6092287464e70697d73de8ee8eb56db.webm?t=1781837826\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2699950/extras/a6092287464e70697d73de8ee8eb56db.mp4?t=1781837826\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Campaign - From Beginner to Advanced</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you're a complete novice or looking to sharpen your skills, our campaign mode helps you build your Sudoku skills step by step. We guide you from the absolute basics to intermediate and advanced strategies. Learn to spot Obvious/Hidden Singles, master Hidden and Obvious Sets, and tackle complex patterns like X-Wings, XYZ-Wings, and Skyscrapers. With clear, easy-to-understand explanations, clear diagrams, and targeted practice puzzles, you'll understand the &quot;why&quot; and &quot;how&quot; behind every move.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2699950/extras/daecb11705afa220b15d16d04d26e29a.poster.avif?t=1781837826\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2699950/extras/daecb11705afa220b15d16d04d26e29a.webm?t=1781837826\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2699950/extras/daecb11705afa220b15d16d04d26e29a.mp4?t=1781837826\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Analyze - Study Puzzles</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Analyze feature searches the Sudoku grid to find all possible techniques that can be applied, along with text explaining the elimination logic. It's great if you want to learn how to solve a specific puzzle, or study specific techniques.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2699950/extras/ec142fc4937430c91247b763eee501c7.poster.avif?t=1781837826\" width=1170 height=734 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2699950/extras/ec142fc4937430c91247b763eee501c7.webm?t=1781837826\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2699950/extras/ec142fc4937430c91247b763eee501c7.mp4?t=1781837826\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Master Techniques with Partial Puzzles</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Want to master a specific technique like Hidden Triple? Our partial puzzles in Custom Game let you practice just that. You will be presented with a puzzle advanced to the exact point where you only need to find the pattern and do the eliminations. It's a very efficient way to practice specific techniques.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2699950/extras/c83d3b556ed95d8698d4bdf706fb099b.poster.avif?t=1781837826\" width=1170 height=674 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2699950/extras/c83d3b556ed95d8698d4bdf706fb099b.webm?t=1781837826\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2699950/extras/c83d3b556ed95d8698d4bdf706fb099b.mp4?t=1781837826\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Sudoku Editor - Create Your Own Puzzles</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Found a great puzzle you want to play? Want to design unique puzzles to challenge your friends? Sudoku Editor lets you create puzzles freely. Of course, if you prefer not to build them yourself, the generator creates fresh, high-quality puzzles on demand, from easy to expert. You can even choose symmetry patterns to create visually elegant and challenging puzzles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2699950/extras/1c38eef6cc4ba549c59f781c0f7a658f.avif?t=1781837826\" width=1428 height=825 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Sudoku Paint - Create Sudoku Images</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create and share beautiful visual diagrams of your solving strategies. Use tools to highlight cells and candidates, draw chains, add text, and export your creations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2699950/extras/3c837a1c35ebe2c8f2d81ca692b14f32.avif?t=1781837826\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Supported Techniques</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game's play and analysis are based on our high performance Sudoku Solver, which supports a wide range of techniques, including:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Obvious Sets (Obvious Singles, Pairs, Triples, etc.)<br></li><li> Hidden Sets (Hidden Singles, Pairs, Triples, etc.)<br></li><li> Fish Patterns (Pointing, Claiming, X-Wing, Swordfish, Jellyfish, Finned Fish, Mutant Fish etc.)<br></li><li> XYZ-Wing Family (XY-Wing, XYZ-Wing, and generalized versions of XYZ-Wing)<br></li><li> Unique Loops (including Unique Rectangle, Types 1-4, Type 6, Hidden Loop, Avoidable Loop etc.)<br></li><li> Extended Rectangles (Types 1-4, Type 6, Hidden Extended Rectangle, Avoidable Extended Rectangle etc.)<br></li><li> BUG Patterns (Bivalue Universal Grave - Types 1-4, Type 6, Hidden BUG etc.)<br></li><li> AIC Chains (Alternate Inference Chains, including X-Chains, XY-Chains, Two-String Kite, Skyscraper, AIC Type 1, AIC Type 2, Continuous Loop, Discontinuous Loop)<br></li><li> Grouped AIC Chains(including Empty Rectangle, Grouped X-Chains, Grouped AIC Type 1, Grouped AIC Type 2, Grouped Continuous Loop, Grouped Discontinuous Loop)<br></li><li> ALS Chains (Almost Locked Set Chains and Loops, including AKA ALS-XZ, ALS-XY-Wing etc.)<br></li><li> ALS Blossom (Almost Locked Set Blossom patterns, AKA Death Blossom)<br></li><li> Sue de Coq</li></ul>",
        "about_the_game": "<u><strong>Rated Sudoku helps you learn faster and sharpen your Sudoku skills with a powerful set of tools for every part of the Sudoku experience, from playing and analyzing to editing, generating, and painting.</strong></u><br><br><u><strong>Built on a high performance solving engine, our Analyze Screen identifies complex techniques quickly — much faster than typical Sudoku games.</strong></u><br><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Note: This game supports <strong>ONLY standard 9x9</strong> Sudoku rules. No variants (e.g., Killer Sudoku) are included.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Note: It is <strong>NOT</strong> recommended to play this game on Steam Deck.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Hint System - Help When You Need It Most</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stuck on a puzzle? Get help right from the Play Screen. The game offers two levels of hints: vague hints and detailed hints. Click the hint button once to receive a vague hint with partial highlighting, giving you a chance to spot the technique on your own. Click it again to reveal a detailed hint with full highlighting and a full explanation. The explanation is detailed enough that you might even learn the technique on the spot.</p><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2699950/extras/d23c6ae9038337c8b1fac8b59d2bd7f2.poster.avif?t=1781837826\" width=1170 height=674 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2699950/extras/d23c6ae9038337c8b1fac8b59d2bd7f2.webm?t=1781837826\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2699950/extras/d23c6ae9038337c8b1fac8b59d2bd7f2.mp4?t=1781837826\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Play - Efficient Input System</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tired of slow manual input of candidates and making mistakes? Our unique skill input system revolutionizes the way you play Sudoku. Simply spot a pattern like an X-Wing, select a relevant cell, click the &quot;Fish&quot; skill, and watch the eliminations happen automatically. No more manual candidate management or fear of errors—the game handles the work, letting you focus on the fun of solving. If the skill doesn't apply to the cell, nothing will happen, ensuring a completely error-free experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2699950/extras/a6092287464e70697d73de8ee8eb56db.poster.avif?t=1781837826\" width=1170 height=674 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2699950/extras/a6092287464e70697d73de8ee8eb56db.webm?t=1781837826\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2699950/extras/a6092287464e70697d73de8ee8eb56db.mp4?t=1781837826\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Campaign - From Beginner to Advanced</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you're a complete novice or looking to sharpen your skills, our campaign mode helps you build your Sudoku skills step by step. We guide you from the absolute basics to intermediate and advanced strategies. Learn to spot Obvious/Hidden Singles, master Hidden and Obvious Sets, and tackle complex patterns like X-Wings, XYZ-Wings, and Skyscrapers. With clear, easy-to-understand explanations, clear diagrams, and targeted practice puzzles, you'll understand the &quot;why&quot; and &quot;how&quot; behind every move.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2699950/extras/daecb11705afa220b15d16d04d26e29a.poster.avif?t=1781837826\" width=1170 height=658 ><source sr