iming, X-Wing, Swordfish, Jellyfish, Finned Fish, Mutant Fish etc.)<br></li><li> XYZ-Wing Family (XY-Wing, XYZ-Wing, and generalized versions of XYZ-Wing)<br></li><li> Unique Loops (including Unique Rectangle, Types 1-4, Type 6, Hidden Loop, Avoidable Loop etc.)<br></li><li> Extended Rectangles (Types 1-4, Type 6, Hidden Extended Rectangle, Avoidable Extended Rectangle etc.)<br></li><li> BUG Patterns (Bivalue Universal Grave - Types 1-4, Type 6, Hidden BUG etc.)<br></li><li> AIC Chains (Alternate Inference Chains, including X-Chains, XY-Chains, Two-String Kite, Skyscraper, AIC Type 1, AIC Type 2, Continuous Loop, Discontinuous Loop)<br></li><li> Grouped AIC Chains(including Empty Rectangle, Grouped X-Chains, Grouped AIC Type 1, Grouped AIC Type 2, Grouped Continuous Loop, Grouped Discontinuous Loop)<br></li><li> ALS Chains (Almost Locked Set Chains and Loops, including AKA ALS-XZ, ALS-XY-Wing etc.)<br></li><li> ALS Blossom (Almost Locked Set Blossom patterns, AKA Death Blossom)<br></li><li> Sue de Coq</li></ul>",
